From 52a5c61244ffbef5b385d3b309e45a811066321f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:01:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add TraverseToStart, TraverseToCenterBerm, and IsBeached
 states

- arena_markers: track Berm polygon and Start approach arrow; add berm_goal(standoff) and start_goal()
- polygon_approach() generalizes construction_goal() with an outward standoff
- arena_configs: placeholder start_approach for ARENA_NASA (not surveyed)
- arena_markers_node: publish Start approach arrow
- outcomes: START_REACHED, BERM_REACHED, NOT_BEACHED
- tests for the new states and arena goals
